-- ─── 044_shipments.sql ───────────────────────────────────────────
-- Phase: shipment & logistics command center.
--
-- Tracks an imported batch from supplier payment → shipping → customs → arrival
-- → delivery, with a milestone timeline and attached documents. Optionally
