### Safe Logistics from China to Tashkent
Tez Motors manages the complete supply chain. We perform a detailed 120-point inspection before dispatching from China, insure the cargo, and transport it via reliable car carriers. Sourcing takes 15-25 days. We also handle all local customs and registration procedures. The vehicle is fully insured during transport to guard against unforeseen risks. We assume full legal responsibility for the vehicle's safety during transit, backed by comprehensive shipping insurance policy.

### Tez Motors Quality Warranty
Every custom-sourced Geely Model 14 Ultra is covered by our standard 2-year warranty. In the event of any components needing service, our clients have access to authorized partner service centers with stocked replacement parts. Warranty details are legally secured in the initial purchase agreement. Our partner service centers are equipped with factory-grade diagnostic tools and keep a constant stock of genuine replacement parts.

> [!TIP]
> When buying a specialty model, consult with our specialists regarding GB/T charging standard compatibility with local charging networks in Uzbekistan. We can supply the necessary charging adapters. We also recommend applying a protective clear bra film to the front bumper.

### How to Order Your Geely Model 14 Ultra?
Get in touch with us today. Tez Motors' managers will prepare a personalized turn-key cost estimate and guide you through the initial steps. We are committed to making your custom vehicle import smooth and completely secure.$$,
