### Tez Motors orqali xavfsiz logistika
Tez Motors to'liq yetkazib berish zanjirini tashkil qiladi. Biz Xitoydan jo'natishdan oldin 120 ta punkt bo'yicha sotuvdan oldingi tekshiruvni o'tkazamiz, yukni sug'urtalaymiz va ishonchli avtovozlarda tashiymiz. Yetkazib berish 15-25 kunni tashkil qiladi. Bojxona va sertifikatlashtirish jarayonlarini o'z zimmamizga olamiz. Yetkazib berish jarayoni to'liq sug'urtalangan va nazorat ostida. Har bir bosqichda sizga hisobot berib boriladi. Avtomobil yo'l davomida to'liq sug'urtalangan bo'lib, har bir transport bosqichi bizning malakali logistlarimiz tomonidan qat'iy nazorat qilinadi.

### Tez Motors kafolat majburiyatlari
Har bir import qilinadigan Changan Model 26 EV avtomobiliga 2 yilgacha bo'lgan standart kafolatimiz beriladi. Ta'mirlash yoki ehtiyot qismlarni almashtirish zarurati tug'ilganda, mijozlarimizga hamkor servis stansiyalarida xizmat ko'rsatiladi. Kafolat muddati shartnomada qonuniy kuchga ega va hamkorlarimiz original butlovchi qismlarni taqdim etadilar. Hamkorlikdagi servis markazlarimiz barcha zarur diagnostika uskunalari va original butlovchi qismlar bilan to'liq jihozlangan.

> [!TIP]
> Noyob modelga buyurtma berishda, zaryadlash portining (GB/T) O'zbekistondagi ommaviy stansiyalarga mos kelishi bo'yicha mutaxassislarimiz bilan maslahatlashing. Biz kerakli adapterlarni tanlashda yordam beramiz. Shuningdek, kuzovni himoya plyonka bilan qoplashni tavsiya qilamiz. Bu avtomobil ko'rinishini saqlaydi.

### Changan Model 26 EV sotib olishni qanday boshlash kerak?
Hoziroq biz bilan bog'laning. Tez Motors menejerlari siz uchun shaxsiy hisob-kitobni tayyorlaydilar va qulay variantlarni taklif qiladilar. Biz xarid qilish jarayonini boshidan oxirigacha xavfsiz va shaffof tarzda amalga oshiramiz. Sizga eng yaxshi xizmatlarni taqdim etish bizning asosiy vazifamizdir. Biz bilan xarid qilish oson va yoqimli.$$,
    $$# Importing specialty and unique vehicle configurations, such ...
Importing specialty and unique vehicle configurations, such as the **Changan Model 26 EV**, is rapidly gaining popularity among car enthusiasts in Uzbekistan. Since this model is rarely available in Tashkent showrooms, ordering directly from China through a trusted import partner is the ideal solution. In this article, we outline the step-by-step import procedure, key selling points, and turn-key sourcing terms provided by Tez Motors. Our goal is to make the entire process of vehicle sourcing transparent, safe, and highly cost-effective. At Tez Motors, we strive to deliver the highest quality of service by selecting verified suppliers and ensuring absolute pricing transparency throughout the sourcing pipeline.

### Benefits of Sourcing the Changan Model 26 EV
Despite its niche positioning, this model delivers outstanding value:
- **Excellent Value-for-Money:** Sourced at a competitive rate, buyers receive a modern car with a rich set of features rarely found on locally assembled models.
- **Highly Economical:** The efficient electric or hybrid drivetrain dramatically lowers daily commuting and charging expenses.
- **Modern Infotainment & Styling:** Intuitive cabin ergonomics, a large responsive touchscreen, and high-quality interior materials.
- **Robust Build Quality:** A proven platform built to meet modern passive and active vehicle safety standards.

### Specialty Sourcing and Customs Procedures
Buying niche configurations requires close attention to vehicle specifications. Tez Motors helps customers explore factory options, including upgraded battery packs, winter packages, and premium sound systems, to ensure the delivered car matches your exact specifications. We maintain direct channels with manufacturers and official dealerships across China. Our specialists manage the entire customs clearance workflow and resolve any potential import hurdles to ensure a seamless experience for you.

### Cabin Ergonomics and Space Efficiency
The interior of the Changan Model 26 EV focuses heavily on space optimization. Practical storage compartments, cup holders, and customizable seating configurations ensure a comfortable environment for all occupants. Solid build quality and tight panel gaps eliminate squeaks and rattles over time, highlighting the manufacturer's commitment to factory standards. Soft LED cabin lighting creates a cozy atmosphere. The ergonomic interior layout is tailored to reduce driver fatigue during extended trips, providing a serene environment for all passengers.

### Multimedia Features and Driver Assistance
The vehicle features a digital dashboard and a central touchscreen interface. GPS navigation, Bluetooth smartphone integration, and a clear audio system make driving enjoyable. The basic driver assistance package includes parking sensors, a rearview camera, and a tire pressure monitoring system, making navigating tight urban environments straightforward. Active safety sensors help keep the vehicle stable. Integrated driver assistance features and smart control systems ensure that even novice drivers can navigate busy streets with maximum confidence.

### Technical Reliability and Climate Adaptation
The Changan Model 26 EV comes equipped with an efficient heating and air conditioning system, ensuring comfort during both sub-zero winter mornings and intense summer heat. The suspension is optimized to absorb local road imperfections smoothly. Onboard electrical systems are fully sealed against water and dust intrusion, which is crucial for local roads. The underside chassis protection and heavy-duty suspension elements are specifically designed to withstand rugged driving conditions on local suburban roads.

